  "description": "Fast object-graph loading for legacy and modern .NET apps, built in large part for heavy legacy applications. Loads an entity with its children in one SQL query that returns each row once (SQL Server FOR JSON / PostgreSQL json_agg), fixing slow Include chains, N+1 queries and cartesian explosion without rewriting data access. Runs on .NET Framework 4.6.2-4.8.1, .NET Standard 2.0 and .NET 8/10. Core library: mapping, fluent query builder, LINQ Where, JSON deserialization. Install a provider package (EF6, NHibernate, Dapper, Standalone ADO.NET, EF Core). Report issues at https://github.com/rubiconmp/public-issues",
